        {
          "en": "What is it?",
          "zh": "什么是它？",
          "startMs": 38340,
          "endMs": 39678
        },
        {
          "en": "To help children practise describing things.",
          "zh": "到帮助孩子们练习描述东西。",
          "startMs": 39678,
          "endMs": 45031
        },
        {
          "en": "Think of an animal and describe it in two or three sentences.",
          "zh": "想的一个动物和描述它在……里二或者三句子。",
          "startMs": 45031,
          "endMs": 52451
        },
        {
          "en": "Can children guess the animal you are describing?",
          "zh": "能孩子们猜测这动物你是描述？",
          "startMs": 52451,
          "endMs": 58412
        },
        {
          "en": "Children then describe an animal for you to guess.",
          "zh": "孩子们然后描述一个动物为了你到猜测。",
          "startMs": 58412,
          "endMs": 64494
        },
        {
          "en": "Have several goes each.",
          "zh": "有几个去每个。",
          "startMs": 64494,
          "endMs": 67292
        },
        {
          "en": "You can use these ideas straight away or on another day.",
          "zh": "你能使用这些主意直的离开或者在……上另一个一天。",
          "startMs": 67292,
          "endMs": 74104
        },
        {
          "en": "• Ask children to count the number of times 'what' is repeated in the story.",
          "zh": "• 问孩子们到数数这数字的时间 '什么' 是不停的在……里这故事。",
          "startMs": 74104,
          "endMs": 83349
        },
        {
          "en": "Practise spelling 'what'.",
          "zh": "练习拼写 '什么'。",
          "startMs": 83349,
          "endMs": 86390
        },
        {
